            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 4. परीक्षा के लिए ज़रूरी फॉर्मूले (Formula Sheet)",
            "start": 2437,
            "end": 2490
          },
          {
            "id": "p39",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "न्यूमेरिकल्स (Numericals) सॉल्व करने के लिए आपको बस यह 2 मुख्य फॉर्मूले याद रखने हैं:",
            "start": 2492,
            "end": 2577
          },
          {
            "id": "p40",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "1. **अगर वज़न (Mass) दिया हो और मोल निकालना हो:**",
            "start": 2579,
            "end": 2628
          },
          {
            "id": "p41",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   $$\\text{Moles } (n) = \\frac{\\text{Given Mass (दिया गया वज़न)}}{\\text{Molar Mass (मोलर द्रव्यमान)}} = \\frac{m}{M}$$",
            "start": 2629,
            "end": 2746
          },
          {
            "id": "p42",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2. **अगर कणों की संख्या (Particles) दी हो और मोल निकालना हो:**",
            "start": 2748,
            "end": 2810
          },
          {
            "id": "p43",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   $$\\text{Moles } (n) = \\frac{\\text{Number of Particles (कणों की संख्या)}}{\\text{Avogadro's Number } (N_A)} = \\frac{N}{6.022 \\times 10^{23}}$$",
            "start": 2811,
            "end": 2954
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The formulas n = m/M and n = N/N_A are correct representations of mole relationships.",
          "errors": []
        }
